{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_cutter_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_cutter_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "速食食品",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_cutter_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "83a5f34032802533e27f79f7c16cb25ba183bd797e6ede93b74206722fe1fd82",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有人说，雇佣兵就像速食食品一样。\n开袋即食，用之即弃。高效率，低风险，在战场上是最好用的消耗品。\n只是，如果有选择的话，任谁都会更愿意吃温热新鲜的食物，任谁都不会愿意冒着丢掉性命的风险去挣买食物的钱。\n如果有选择的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "各单位注意，目标已经进入警戒范围，预计还有一分钟到达防御点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "请各单位于三十秒内完成应急准备，重复一遍，三十秒内完成应急准备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "完毕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "那个，我来看看有没有什么需要帮忙的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "text": "哎，是刻刀呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "text": "来得正好，尝尝我做的蔬菜烤饼，刚出炉的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "谢谢，我尝尝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "嗯......我觉得很好吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "text": "哈哈，这可是我的拿手好菜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "text": "喜欢的话就多拿几个吧，不用客气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "唔，谢谢，还是不用了。我只是来看看，有没有我可以帮忙的事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "text": "欸？可是我这里的菜都已经准备得差不多了呢，你去角峰那边看看吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "喔，是刻刀小姐啊，来得正好，尝尝这道谢拉格风味烩兽肉吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "为了方便取材，我用鳞蜥肉代替了原来的配方，调味也相应地做了点改动，正想找人帮我尝尝呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "嗯，好的，我来试试。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "（咀嚼咀嚼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "很好吃。虽然说不上为什么......但就是很好吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "说不上为什么好吃啊......嗯，看来是不够有特色，还需要改进啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "不是的，只是我不太会描述......我认为角峰先生的厨艺已经非常好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "话说，角峰先生这里有什么需要帮忙的地方吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "哈哈哈，我这里没什么需要帮忙的啦，菜都已经上锅，就剩关火了。你一会去古米那里看看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "啊对了，还请稍等，有一件事确实需要刻刀小姐的帮忙。我今天试做了好几道新菜，就麻烦刻刀小姐帮我把把关了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "刻刀姐姐！尝尝古米烤的馅饼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "快要吃饱了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "古米这里有什么需要帮忙的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米这里只有烤好的馅饼哦~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "那，我就尝一个好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "好吃吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "应该是......好吃的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "呜......吃不下了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "明明只是想来帮忙，怎么变成来提前解决午饭了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "（叹气）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "其实大家都很照顾我呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我来帮忙啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "text": "呼，铸铁你可来了。快来帮帮忙吧，今天有两个后勤干员同时请假了，只靠我们三个可真是忙不过来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "拼尽全力倒也能够完成，可也实在是太勉强了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米的手好酸......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "真是辛苦啦，我这就来帮忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "咦，我刚在食堂里看到刻刀了，看起来好像很失落的样子，发生什么事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "text": "说起来铸铁不是经常来厨房，所以还不知道啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一个月前"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "大家好，辛苦了......请问有什么我可以帮忙的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "喔喔，是新来的刻刀小姐啊，正好，麻烦你把那边的土豆切成块好了，一会炖汤用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "嗯，好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "刻刀小姐！我是让你把土豆切块不是让你把砧板切块啊！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "对不起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "我不是故意的，我会赔偿的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "算了算了，倒也不用......我明白了，刻刀小姐是不习惯用这种菜刀吧。那麻烦你去盯着那锅汤好了，记得多用勺子搅拌一下，别煮煳了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "我明白了，我一定会做好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "搅拌，搅拌，不能煮煳，搅拌......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "搅拌，搅拌......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "（嗅）什么味道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "text": "虽然看到刻刀失落的样子也会于心不忍，但是，作为罗德岛厨房的一员，绝对不能允许那种可怕的事情再次发生了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "后勤姐姐之前很认真地考虑过要在“小刻禁止入内”的标志旁边加上“刻刀禁止入内”的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "不必要的损失，还是尽量避免为好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "嗯，我明白了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "绝对不可以！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "刻刀！站住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "哎？铸铁小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "绝对不可以半途而废！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "这样真的不会给大家添麻烦吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "没关系，现在离晚饭时间还早，肯定来得及收拾完的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "真的是，非常感谢您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "不用客气。我只是觉得，既然有想要尝试的事，就一定要坚持到底才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "所以，从今天开始，我要对你进行烹饪技能的特训！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "放心吧，有我在，绝对不会让之前的事故重演的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "我一定会努力的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "谢谢您，铸铁小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "在训练中要叫我教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "是！教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "（哈哈，原来被称为教官是这种感觉啊。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "咳咳，教官提问！你觉得烹饪是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "把食物弄熟？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "错！大错特错！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "烹饪可不是把食材弄熟这么简单。记好了，烹饪指的是，根据食材的特性，把食物变得美味可口的手段！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "我，我记住了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "看来刻刀是完全没有基础呢，那我们就要从最基本的训练开始了。听我命令，立正！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "是！教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "首先，是做任何菜肴都需要用到的，也是最基本的技术——刀工。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "听我的口令，拿刀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "是——左手还是右手......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "嗯，用惯用手就好......然后用另一只手握住这颗土豆。像我这样，用刀沿着土豆的轮廓，轻轻削去这层皮......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "沿着轮廓......轻轻......削飞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "怎么会这样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "刻刀小姐应该很擅长用刀才对啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "砍菜和砍敌人的手感完全不一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "虽然的确如此啦......但食材可不是敌人呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "不管怎么说，任何技能都有一个熟能生巧的过程。我们继续练习吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "好，好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "铸铁小姐好厉害，我从来不敢想象，土豆泥也可以这么好吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "哈哈，毕竟不能浪费食物嘛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "（那么多土豆切成那样，我也着实想不到别的处理方法了啊。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "其实烹饪也没有那么难啦。你看，只要熟悉了菜刀，你现在不是也可以很熟练地给土豆削皮了嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "结果等着下锅的时候又差点把锅烧穿了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "刻刀你还是太紧张啦，烹饪和刀术可不一样，你不能指望像完成任务那样，模仿老师的每个动作就能学会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "烹饪啊，是要在了解食材的特点后，满怀希望地把食材做成自己期待的样子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "对！重点是心怀希望！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "好像很有道理，嗯，我记住了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "说起来，刻刀小姐为什么想要学习厨艺呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "罗德岛的食堂里的菜式品类很多，喜欢什么口味应该都可以找到的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "因为，从来没有吃过速食食品之外的食物，所以很想试试，亲手做出可以吃的东西是什么样的感觉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "似乎也不能说“从来没有”，只是从记事起就一直跟着师父，师父又是不会做饭的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "再后来，成为雇佣兵之后，就更没有机会坐下来安稳吃一顿饭了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "曾经非常好奇食物到底是怎么做出来的，就溜去酒馆的后厨里看了看，结果被老板当作小偷抓住了，之后被狠狠骂了一顿，哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "刻刀！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "啊！在！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我一定会教会你做菜的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "就算再用十个土豆，不，就算再用上百个土豆，我也一定要教会你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "那个，铸铁小姐还请冷静一点，毕竟都是过去的事了，你看，我还是健康地活下来了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "解决掉这些土豆泥我们就接着开始训练吧！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "好，好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "结果真的把厨房的土豆用光了......铸铁小姐说去找点别的食材......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "有点累了......想睡觉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "不行不行，不能辜负铸铁小姐的心意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "现在才刚刚学会了给土豆削皮而已，怎么可以偷懒呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "呼啊......可是下午的阳光，好舒服......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "有点困了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "就休息一小会......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喂，醒醒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵A",
      "text": "喂，给你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵A",
      "text": "真亏你还睡得着啊。不过也好，离出发还有点时间，尽量保留体力吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵A",
      "text": "喂，那边那个，接着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "又是罐头？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵A",
      "text": "有罐头吃就不错了，知道在荒野上丢了物资的雇佣兵是什么下场吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵A",
      "text": "筋疲力尽地倒在荒野上，食腐的源石虫会把你当成尸体，从腿部开始啃你的衣服。等它开始吃你的肉的时候，你还是清醒的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "啊，说起来，想吃炭烤沙虫腿了，最好是现烤的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵A",
      "text": "*哥伦比亚粗口*，别做梦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "喂，就不能烤点肉？烧锅汤也行啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "不可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "这里是荒野，又没有风，点火不小心弄出烟来，好几公里外都看得见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "这就相当于对附近所有雇佣兵宣布“这里可能有商队”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "我们这次负责护送货物，暴露行踪是大忌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "哟呵，小姑娘还挺老练。看你年纪不大，这第几次出来跑了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "数不清了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "除了诈骗和人口贩卖，什么都干过。论入行时间，可能比你还早点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "哈，口气不小。你又咋知道我是啥时候入行的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "你的刀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "你的刀是雷神工业去年的设计，用的是新材料，重量是前代的一半。你挂刀的腰带上也没什么磨损，应该是从来没有用过别的刀吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "好家伙，还真是行家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "实话说，我也是家里的农田被天灾毁了才出来干这个的。要不是没地种，谁愿意干把脑袋别裤腰带上的营生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "哈，但别看我入行时间短，还从来没有失手过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "一会遇上劫货的，就让你们瞧瞧我的本事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵A",
      "text": "呸，别说晦气的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "开玩笑开玩笑......这次保密可是做得够好的，临出发前才把路线图交到我们手里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "这是常用的保密方式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "有的雇主会事先准备多个路线图，全部密封起来。临出发时再由中间人随机挑选一张地图交到佣兵手里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "佣兵接到地图时，要是看到密封条有被打开过的痕迹，就可以拒绝出发。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "这样可以避免佣兵和雇主直接联络，也排除了泄密的可能。这次的雇主倒是专业的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "好家伙，这些箱子里装的到底是什么东西，值得这样小题大做的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵A",
      "text": "我们只管把货物交到指定的地方，领钱走人就是。别的也管不着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "说的也是。不过这次给的不少，箱子里肯定是更值钱的东西吧！感觉自己身价都高贵了不少，哈哈哈哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "等一拿到钱，我就在镇上找个酒吧，先醉个一天一夜再说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "这样的活再多接几单，我就可以去南边再买一块地，还可以再开一个啤酒农场，哈哈哈哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "你们呢？拿到钱准备干嘛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵A",
      "text": "我可没你那兴致，先找家武器铺保养我的弩才是正事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "那个小姑娘，你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "买个新发卡吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "噗——你说啥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "之前的发卡弄丢了，前面的头发会挡住眼睛，好烦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵A",
      "text": "噗哈哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "到底有什么好笑的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "只有我们两个活下来了吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "敌人的进攻显然是有预谋的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "虽然不知道具体发生了什么，但一定是有人故意把我们的位置暴露出去了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "你要干什么？别再管货物了，我们已经暴露了，迟早会有更多人找上来的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "让开！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "任务已经失败了！赶紧去前面的城镇想办法处理你的伤——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "你看看我脖子上这个源石结晶，我还能有命吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "我已经是要死的人了！我他妈就想要看看，我到底是为什么东西死的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "你没有必要这样——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "哈......哈哈......哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "空的，里面是空的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "我们他妈的从一开始就是诱饵，那笔钱，就是用来买我们命的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "我真蠢，怎么就相信了别人的鬼话，说什么当雇佣兵随随便便就能赚到花不完的钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "哈哈哈......可不是嘛，只要死得够早，就用不到钱了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵B",
      "text": "都该死！雇佣兵全部都该死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喂喂，刻刀？醒醒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "啊！抱歉，我刚好像睡着了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "最近的训练确实有些辛苦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "但不管怎么说，现在可是验收这一个月来刻苦训练的成果的时候，要精神点啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "准备好了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "嗯......嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "（紧张地吞咽口水）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "（小心翼翼地揭开锅盖）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "终于......完成了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "喔喔！看起来还不错嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "刻刀，我就知道你可以的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "多谢铸铁小姐的帮助，只靠我一个人的话，肯定是不行的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "别说那么多啦，快让我尝尝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "请，请稍等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "还是让我自己先尝尝吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "（咀嚼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "好像......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "好像？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "不是很好吃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "欸？让我尝尝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "明明很好吃啊！刻刀你也太谦虚了吧！如果不知道的话，说是角峰大哥做的我都信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "铸铁小姐过誉啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "不对不对，应该说很有刻刀的特色！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "你说“结课作业”打算做“沙虫罐头烩饭”的时候我还吓了一跳，我真的没有想到会这么好吃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "原本罐头里过重的调料味被米饭中和了，沙虫肉经过重新加工后口感也变好了很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "唔，加进来的土豆泥也可谓神来之笔！我觉得可以考虑把这道菜列入罗德岛食堂食谱！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "因为想到铸铁小姐说过的，“要把熟悉的食材做成自己期待的样子”，想来想去，自己熟悉的食物只有沙虫罐头了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "说明你已经掌握烹饪技术的精髓啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "现在我也只会做这一道菜啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "是第一道菜，也是一个全新的开始！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "嗯，我记住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "text": "不只是完成任务，是要带着希望......做成自己期待的样子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
